---
# Tests read as scenarios. Catch2 assertions expand to branches (which inflate the cognitive complexity of a test
# case) and are invisible to the dataflow checks (an optional checked with REQUIRE still looks unchecked), and a
# helper that walks a JSON tree is recursive by nature.
InheritParentConfig: true
Checks: >
  -readability-function-cognitive-complexity,
  -bugprone-unchecked-optional-access,
  -misc-no-recursion,
  -bugprone-easily-swappable-parameters,
  -cppcoreguidelines-non-private-member-variables-in-classes
...
